<title>POLAND: ARIEL NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARIEL NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.33 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.55 vs   0.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.21 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Sales		    1.43 vs   2.87</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.86 vs   2.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.12 vs   2.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.93 vs   3.02</p>
<p> Sales		   14.12 vs  13.22</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish shoe producer is Ariel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
